WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:26.791
Must the engine read every record again?

00:00:26.791 --> 00:00:56.805
One collection, two directions

00:00:56.805 --> 00:01:23.964
The identifiers do the work

00:01:23.964 --> 00:01:51.437
Change the operator, keep the index

00:01:51.437 --> 00:02:26.505
Go directly. Move forwards.

00:02:26.505 --> 00:02:59.069
A posting can carry more than an identifier

00:02:59.069 --> 00:03:33.386
Full-text search does not promise full-article coverage

00:03:33.386 --> 00:04:04.167
We have a set. Who should come first?
